License: MIT OR Apache-2.0, MPL-2.0
License File: N/A (see the crate manifests)
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes

Description:
An allocator-agnostic crate for measuring the heap size of a value

Local Modifications:
The crates (11) live in third_party/stylo/<crate>, one directory per package; their manifests are rewritten by
tools/flatten.py (path dependencies, inlined workspace inheritance, one version per crate) and patched by
tools/fixups.sh and tools/patches/. Everything else of the upstream is in third_party/stylo/ unchanged.

